      <h1 class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Peristaltic Pump for Chemical Dosing: Complete Selection Guide</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-slate-300">Chemical dosing needs a pump that meters small, consistent volumes of aggressive liquid into a process stream without leaking, vaporizing or plugging. Here is what to check when selecting a peristaltic pump for dosing duty.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-400">By Ray Chan · August 24, 2026 · ~13 min read</p>
